<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>VM on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/vm/</link><description>Recent content in VM on 酷玛阁 | KumaTea's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2023 23:01:21 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.kmtea.eu/tags/vm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>PVE 更新 OpenWrt 教程</title><link>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Dec 2022 17:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post PVE 更新 OpenWrt 教程" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="pve-更新-openwrt"&gt;PVE 更新 OpenWrt&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id="准备工作"&gt;准备工作&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;OpenWrt 固件&#10;&lt;img alt="Firmware" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="600px" data-flex-grow="250" height="373" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/01-firmware.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/01-firmware_hu_8e2f0ab1302765e6.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/01-firmware.jpg 933w" width="933"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;建议编译时 &lt;strong&gt;不要&lt;/strong&gt; 选中 &lt;code&gt;gzip&lt;/code&gt; 压缩，否则容易出现各种奇妙的问题&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;一般情况下不选用名称带有 &lt;code&gt;rootfs&lt;/code&gt; 的固件&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;USB 网卡 (可选)&#10;&lt;img alt="USB Ethernet" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="720" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/02-usb.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/02-usb_hu_e26fdfeb77446636.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/02-usb.jpg 1280w" width="1280"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;如果你和我一样把全部网口都直通了，则需要在更新时使用其他的方式连接到 PVE&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;PVE 默认不会自动启用新插入的网卡，你可能需要&#10;&lt;code&gt;ifup enx00xxxxxxxxxx &amp;amp;&amp;amp; ip link set dev enx00xxxxxxxxxx up&lt;/code&gt;&#10;其中网卡名 &lt;code&gt;enx00xxxxxxxxxx&lt;/code&gt; 可以在 &lt;code&gt;ifconfig&lt;/code&gt; 查询&#10;&lt;img alt="ifup" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/03-ifup.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/03-ifup_hu_9b34209fcac969b4.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/03-ifup_hu_88e08833c6c41edf.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/03-ifup.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="为什么不能用正常方式升级"&gt;为什么不能用正常方式升级？&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;众所周知，OpenWrt 正常升级方式是在 &lt;code&gt;系统&lt;/code&gt; - &lt;code&gt;备份升级&lt;/code&gt; 中升级：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Upgrade" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="486px" data-flex-grow="202" height="934" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/04-upgrade.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/04-upgrade_hu_5c25c7c7c498f237.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/04-upgrade_hu_1a51edf233e05b2c.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/04-upgrade.jpg 1892w" width="1892"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;但你会发现 x86 固件是不包含 &lt;code&gt;sysupgrade&lt;/code&gt; 固件的：&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Checksum" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="589px" data-flex-grow="245" height="535" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/05-checksum.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/05-checksum_hu_ac931d20706845b9.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/05-checksum.jpg 1313w" width="1313"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;所以，对于运行在 Proxmox VE 中的 OpenWrt 虚拟机，我们只能通过手动方式升级&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在开始之前，请确保你划分了一块虚拟硬盘作为 &lt;code&gt;overlay&lt;/code&gt; 分区放置配置。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="overlay" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/06-overlay.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/06-overlay_hu_c2c69dbd939eb746.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/06-overlay_hu_7f3163275eb07ce3.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/06-overlay.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;如果没有，我强烈建议你花十分钟搜下教程&#10;(关键词 &lt;code&gt;extroot overlay&lt;/code&gt;)&#10;完成这件事， &lt;strong&gt;功在当代利在千秋&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="上传新固件"&gt;上传新固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;上传到 &lt;code&gt;local&lt;/code&gt; - &lt;code&gt;ISO&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Upload firmware" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/07-upload.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/07-upload_hu_410f0e3765cf2494.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/07-upload_hu_c9fd07ccf3f5b2c6.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/07-upload.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;推荐检查 &lt;code&gt;sha256sum&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="更换系统固件"&gt;更换系统固件&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;在以非目标 OpenWrt 内网的方式连接 PVE 的情况下，关闭虚拟机 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Shutdown" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/08-shutdown.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/08-shutdown_hu_a05dc439b5dbae9a.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/08-shutdown_hu_ffeb17a19c058a90.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/08-shutdown.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&#10;可以用 PVE 的 &lt;code&gt;Shutdown&lt;/code&gt; 按钮，也可以在 Console 输入 &lt;code&gt;poweroff&lt;/code&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;选中系统盘 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Select" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="600px" data-flex-grow="250" height="434" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/09-select.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/09-select_hu_a24b397029be4090.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/09-select.jpg 1085w" width="1085"&gt;&#10;点击 &lt;code&gt;Detach&lt;/code&gt; 并确认 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Detach" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="582px" data-flex-grow="242" height="387" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/10-detach.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/10-detach_hu_f27f214b2a1e3546.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/10-detach.jpg 939w" width="939"&gt;&#10;再在下方找到 &lt;code&gt;Unused Disk 0&lt;/code&gt; 并 &lt;code&gt;Remove&lt;/code&gt; 删除 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Remove" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="423px" data-flex-grow="176" height="730" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/11-remove.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/11-remove_hu_732f572fc40f0d65.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/11-remove.jpg 1288w" width="1288"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;导入新固件 &lt;br&gt;&#10;来到 &lt;strong&gt;PVE 的 Console&lt;/strong&gt; 输入： &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;code&gt;qm importdisk 101 /var/lib/vz/template/iso/openwrt-x86-64-generic-squashfs-combined-efi.img local-lvm&lt;/code&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;其中 &lt;code&gt;101&lt;/code&gt; 是你的 OpenWrt 虚拟机 ID&#10;&lt;img alt="Import" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/12-import.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/12-import_hu_3c5d214dc55f59de.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/12-import_hu_e25377f4ef688d02.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/12-import.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&#10;随后一个新的 &lt;code&gt;Unused Disk 0&lt;/code&gt; 出现了&#10;&lt;img alt="Found new Unused" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="461px" data-flex-grow="192" height="819" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/13-disk.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/13-disk_hu_9068057afa8982f9.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/13-disk.jpg 1576w" width="1576"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;启用新系统盘 &lt;br&gt;&#10;选中新的 &lt;code&gt;Unused Disk 0&lt;/code&gt; 并点击 &lt;code&gt;Edit&lt;/code&gt;，确认即可 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Attach Unused Disk 0" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="597px" data-flex-grow="248" height="562" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/14-edit.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/14-edit_hu_380d7b473194812.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/14-edit.jpg 1398w" width="1398"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;启动虚拟机&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="恢复配置"&gt;恢复配置&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;按一下回车激活 Console &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Activate console" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/15-console.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/15-console_hu_291ccdd09d68cd1e.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/15-console_hu_de5e7c89ec8dc4be.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/15-console.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;此时，原先的 &lt;code&gt;overlay&lt;/code&gt; 会被自动挂载为 &lt;code&gt;/mnt/sda1&lt;/code&gt; (有时是 &lt;code&gt;sdb1&lt;/code&gt;) &lt;br&gt;&#10;我们可以发现，该目录下 &lt;code&gt;etc&lt;/code&gt; 内含有一 &lt;code&gt;.extroot-uuid&lt;/code&gt; 文件。 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Cleanup" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="526px" data-flex-grow="219" height="445" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/16-cleanup.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/16-cleanup_hu_be1495dcc2d116e6.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/16-cleanup.jpg 977w" width="977"&gt;&#10;这一文件会误导系统读取正确的 UUID 并导致无法挂载！ &lt;br&gt;&#10;使用 &lt;code&gt;rm -rf /mnt/sda1/etc&lt;/code&gt; 将之删除。 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;code&gt;/etc/fstab&lt;/code&gt; 也是没用的： &lt;code&gt;rm -f /etc/fstab&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;查看自动生成的 &lt;code&gt;/etc/config/fstab&lt;/code&gt; &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Old fstab" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="302px" data-flex-grow="125" height="724" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/17-old-fstab.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/17-old-fstab_hu_4e5b828ec1cc0f6.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/17-old-fstab.jpg 912w" width="912"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;去掉用不到的 &lt;code&gt;boot&lt;/code&gt; 挂载&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;把 &lt;code&gt;sda1&lt;/code&gt; 的 UUID 移动到 &lt;code&gt;overlay&lt;/code&gt; 配置下&#10;&lt;img alt="New fstab" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="357px" data-flex-grow="149" height="838" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/18-new-fstab.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/18-new-fstab_hu_b4e94fb60607e839.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/18-new-fstab.jpg 1250w" width="1250"&gt;&#10;保存后重启&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;ol start="4"&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;把修改的 &lt;code&gt;/etc/config/fstab&lt;/code&gt; 同步到配置分区 &lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;code&gt;cp -a /etc/config/fstab /mnt/sda1/upper/etc/config/&lt;/code&gt;&#10;&lt;img alt="Sync config" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="940px" data-flex-grow="391" height="331" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/19-sync-fstab.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/19-sync-fstab_hu_1b2165cb7f0ce4b0.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/19-sync-fstab.jpg 1297w" width="1297"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="完成"&gt;完成&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;重启&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;检查 &lt;code&gt;df -h&lt;/code&gt;，可发现配置分区已成功挂载！&#10;&lt;img alt="Reboot" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="426px" data-flex-grow="177" height="1080" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/20-reboot.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/20-reboot_hu_8cee2e55835ca135.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/20-reboot_hu_653490f8b128388d.jpg 1600w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/20-reboot.jpg 1920w" width="1920"&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="references"&gt;References&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;我被万恶的 &lt;code&gt;.extroot-uuid&lt;/code&gt; 困扰了几个月之久，直到看到了&#10;&lt;a class="link" href="https://forum.openwrt.org/t/solved-extroot-not-working-on-18-06/16723/2" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&#10; &gt;这篇帖子&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Solution" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="201px" data-flex-grow="84" height="1280" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/21-forum.jpg" srcset="https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/21-forum_hu_7b4c9ec0bd94414b.jpg 800w, https://blog.kmtea.eu/p/221227-pve-openwrt/img/21-forum.jpg 1077w" width="1077"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;因此写这篇教程广而告之。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>